# A way a permanent grants is judged and costed on the face being cast; casting a Room is choosing a door (CR 709.3), so Underworld Breach's
# escape for Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber is the door's mana cost plus three exiled cards. The right door, Ritual Chamber, costs {3}{B}{B}:
# all five of two Mox Jet, a Mox Pearl, the Mox Ruby and the Mountain go to it (Unholy Annex's {2}{B} would have taken three); the Room
# is cast as the right door only because that cost is the door's. It enters with Ritual Chamber's door unlocked and Unholy Annex's locked (CR 709.5d). On turn 3 (Breach is sacrificed at the end step)
# the Lotus pays for Breach and Faithless Looting, which discards the Room and an Island.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Underworld Breach
Mox Pearl
Faithless Looting
Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Underworld Breach.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber; Island)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Graveyard.Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber.Cast(Ability: Ritual Chamber: Escape)
Bot1.Choose(Black Lotus; Faithless Looting; Island)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ritual Chamber.Doors = Ritual Chamber
Bot1.Battlefield.Ritual Chamber.ManaValue = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Demon Token.Power = 6
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile.Count = 3
